course: dictionary
lesson: 11434
title: One word, more than one meaning
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the words around them show you which meaning is needed. Acute is one of these words. «The triangle has three acute angles.» Here acute is a maths word: an acute angle is less than 90 degrees, smaller than a right angle.
explain: «The town faced an acute shortage of clean water.» Acute does not mean sharp here. Ask yourself: what word would fit? Serious or severe fits, so acute means very serious. Put that meaning into the sentence to check that it still makes sense.
explain: «The fox has an acute sense of hearing.» Now acute means very sharp and good, so the fox can hear faint sounds from far away. It is the same word with three different meanings, and the clues around it always tell you which one to use.
fact: Acute can mean very sharp, very serious, or less than 90 degrees, depending on the context.
fact: An acute angle is less than 90 degrees, smaller than a right angle.
fact: An acute triangle has all three angles under 90 degrees.
fact: In health, «acute» means starting suddenly and lasting a short time. Its opposite is chronic, which means lasting a long time.
fact: Useful phrases: acute angle, acute triangle, acute shortage, acutely aware.
exercise: «The triangle has three acute angles.» In maths, what is an acute angle? | Bigger than a full turn | The longest side of a shape | Exactly 90 degrees | *Less than 90 degrees
exercise: «The town faced an acute shortage of clean water.» What does acute mean here? | Happy and calm | *Very serious | Starting slowly | Very sharp
exercise: «The fox has an acute sense of hearing.» What does acute suggest? | Very old | Quiet and gentle | *Very sharp and good | Short and rude
test: «Ben had acute pain in his tooth that started suddenly.» In health, what does acute mean? | *Starting suddenly and lasting a short time | Very small and gentle | Lasting for many years, like a chronic illness | Happening only at night
test: «An acute triangle has all its angles under 90 degrees.» Which shape is an acute triangle? | A circle | *A triangle with all angles under 90 degrees | A triangle with one angle over 90 degrees | A triangle with one right angle
exam: «Ella was acutely aware that the bridge was dangerous.» What does acutely aware mean? | Happy to be late | Not aware at all | Slightly tired | *Very strongly aware
